# PR Review Coverage

When auditing reviewer feedback on a pull request, **fetch both inline comments and top-level reviews**. Top-level review bodies often carry action items that look like approvals from the badge alone (e.g. an APPROVED review whose body says *"LGTM, please consider adding tests to cover the newly introduced repositories."*).

For the full triage workflow — endpoints, OPEN/REPLIED classification script, stale-vs-new categorisation table, reply commands, and the GraphQL pending-review gotchas — load the [`pr-thread-audit` skill](../skills/pr-thread-audit/SKILL.md).
